{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"4501","title":"POCO Pushes Limits with Launch of POCO F7 Series: Extreme Power, Effortless Performance","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today hosted the grand launch event for the F7 Series in Singapore, featuring the highly-anticipated POCO F7 Ultra and POCO F7 Pro, witnessed by key media representatives. ","view_cnt":"6400","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1742548466","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/833_operatorx_operatorx_opx/21/03/2025/744190044ef38a6ba2ab38bfb20f9f0a.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eSingapore, March 27th, 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e – POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today hosted the grand launch event for POCO F7 Series in Singapore, featuring the highly-anticipated POCO F7 Ultra and POCO F7 Pro, witnessed by key media representatives. Designed for all-around excellence and powered by cutting-edge technologies, the flagship duo delivers top-tier speed and efficiency while remaining accessible to more users - staying true to POCO's mission of providing high-performance technology at an exceptional value.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/596_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/03/2025/d8f6aa33959b1edfa20c29a8218a6ed9.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\"With the POCO F7 Series, we've made cutting-edge technology more accessible than ever,\" said Angus Ng, Head of Product Marketing at POCO Global. \"For the first time, we are introducing an Ultra model that takes power and performance to a new level for POCO. By blending flagship features with exceptional pricing, the launch of POCO F7 Ultra and POCO F7 Pro marks a significant leap forward, reflecting our commitment to continuously refreshing the user experience and empowering users to maximize their potential in work, play, and creativity.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDouble the power, double the performance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAt the heart of POCO F7 Ultra is the Snapdragon® 8 Elite Mobile Platform, Qualcomm's most advanced flagship chipset. Built on TSMC's cutting-edge 3nm process technology, this platform delivers a remarkable leap in processing power - boosting CPU performance by up to 45% and GPU performance by 44%¹ while significantly reducing peak power consumption - by as much as 52% for the CPU and 46% for the GPU¹. Achieving an impressive AnTuTu score of 2,843,461², POCO F7 Ultra delivers lightning-fast performance at every turn, from resource-intensive gaming to seamless multitasking.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/213_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/013782a4e2e2a6034c4d592002e851c0.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBut POCO F7 Ultra doesn't stop there. Introducing POCO's first-ever dedicated graphics chip - the VisionBoost D7 chipset, built on an advanced 12nm process - takes visual effects to a whole new level. Gameplay feels incredibly immersive with Smart Frame Rate for ultra-smooth 120FPS³, 2K Super Resolution³ for exceptional clarity, and Game HDR³ for richer contrast. On the video front, Dual-core Visuals⁴ technology enhances resolution, frame rates, and HDR quality across YouTube and Netflix, bringing every scene to life with stunning detail.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eComplementing this powerhouse hardware is Xiaomi HyperOS 2⁵, which delivers intelligent, responsive performance right out of the box. With three core innovations - Xiaomi HyperCore, Xiaomi HyperConnect⁶, and Xiaomi HyperAI⁶ - it optimizes system fluidity, enables seamless cross-platform connectivity, and enhances efficiency with Google Gemini⁷ offering smart assistance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eThe introduction of WildBoost Optimization 4.0 further elevates the experience, working behind the scenes to coordinate the Snapdragon 8 Elite Mobile Platform and VisionBoost D7 chipset. As a result, users enjoy ultra-smooth gameplay with stable frame rates, improved touch and track response, and precise game audio. Even in demanding titles like Genshin Impact at 2K Super Resolution and 120FPS, the device sustains superior performance throughout an hour of gameplay, exceeding native settings with higher frame rates and image quality while keeping temperatures low⁸.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/64_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/0d542a3b4b77f573c357ed04002eb5fb.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eMeanwhile, POCO F7 Pro is powered by the Snapdragon® 8 Gen 3 chipset, striking the perfect balance between speed and efficiency. Running on Xiaomi HyperOS 2⁵ out of the box, POCO F7 Pro delivers fast, fluid performance for a variety of applications and games. Supported by WildBoost Optimization 4.0, gameplay stays buttery smooth and highly responsive with Smart Frame Rate up to 120FPS⁹, including Genshin Impact at 90FPS.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eYet powerful performance doesn't mean your phone has to heat up, thanks to the introduction of LiquidCool Technology 4.0 on POCO F7 Series. Featuring a 3D dual-channel IceLoop system with a 5400mm² extra-large loop heat pipe, this advanced cooling solution reduces SoC temperature by up to 3°C¹º, allowing for extended gaming, video editing, and multitasking sessions without throttling performance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/402_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/3f0273bbc6b4578d11a33ccd4b5b41dc.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eLong-lasting power for nonstop action\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eWith smartphone usage at an all-time high, ultra-efficient battery performance is more important than ever to alleviate battery anxiety, ensuring users stay powered throughout the day. POCO F7 Ultra packs a powerful 5,300mAh (typ) battery, complemented by 120W HyperCharge¹¹ for an ultra-fast 100% charge in just 34 minutes¹², along with 50W wireless HyperCharge¹³ for convenient cable-free power. Meanwhile, POCO F7 Pro is equipped with a 6,000mAh (typ) battery, paired with 90W HyperCharge¹¹ to deliver hours of uninterrupted performance, even during the most demanding tasks.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/985_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/3350cd35cab59ef4812fdcaede76adef.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeyond sheer capacity, both devices feature next-generation charging technologies that boost efficiency and longevity. With POCO Surge P3 charging chipset and POCO Surge G1 battery chipset working together, charging speed and efficiency are optimized, while battery lifespan is extended. Even after 1,600 charging cycles, the battery retains above 80% of its original capacity¹º. Whether in the midst of an intense gaming session or during the workday, these devices provide fast, stable charging - even in challenging conditions like extreme cold weather.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eCapturing the unseen by bringing precision and creativity to every shot\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO F7 Ultra introduces the brand's most advanced imaging system yet. Its triple-lens setup combines POCO's strongest HDR main camera, its first flagship-level floating telephoto lens, and the highest-pixel ultra-wide camera in its lineup. Together, these lenses cover 8 classic focal lengths, offering unparalleled flexibility to capture every scene with incredible detail.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAt the heart of the system, the 50MP main camera, powered by the Light Fusion 800 image sensor, delivers vibrant, detailed shots even in challenging lighting. With four focal lengths, including 35mm for everyday candid shots and 48mm for classic portraits, it's designed to adapt to whatever scene you're capturing. The floating telephoto lens unlocks even more creative possibilities - from capturing intricate 10cm macro shots to reveal the beauty of small details, to 2.5X (60mm) optical zoom for vivid portraits with impressive depth, and 5X (120mm) in-sensor zoom for distant scenes with rich clarity. And with the 32MP ultra-wide camera's 120-degree field of view, users can effortlessly capture sweeping landscapes and group shots in full clarity.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/989_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/46004a6852593beaf46abe4fdec4f590.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAll of this is supercharged by cutting-edge algorithms from POCO AISP - POCO's first-ever AI LM computational photography platform, which integrates the computational power of the CPU, GPU, NPU, and ISP through Xiaomi HyperOS. This seamless integration of software and hardware enhances image processing efficiency, and when combined with the floating telephoto lens, it delivers impressive results. Features like 20X UltraZoom Beta bring intricate details into focus, while UltraSnap supports rapid continuous capture, processing each shot in real time with a complete algorithm to deliver up to 150 frames with consistent image clarity.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/748_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/72be33cb15a14e4376b9868058fe87a4.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eOn the other hand, POCO F7 Pro brings a blend of powerful hardware and AI-driven enhancements to elevate mobile photography in its class. The 50MP main camera, also powered by the Light Fusion 800 image sensor, captures vibrant, highly detailed photos, while the 8MP ultra-wide camera makes it easy to capture expansive landscapes and group shots. Leveraging POCO AISP platform, POCO F7 Pro also offers the UltraSnap feature, along with dual focal length portraits for both wide-angle and classic shots.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor those seeking even more creative possibilities, both devices come with features like Dynamic Shots that bring stills to life, as well as more AI features⁶ for next-level creativity to provide the perfect finishing touch for photos and videos.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAdvanced edge-to-edge display with thoughtful eye-care technologies\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eCrafted to offer a truly exceptional viewing experience, POCO F7 Ultra and POCO F7 Pro feature ultra-slim bezels and cutting-edge eye-care technology, delivering displays that are as comfortable as they are stunning. The Ultra-bright displays, with 3200 nits peak brightness and 1800 nits HBM brightness, deliver vibrant clarity and stunning HDR effects, even under bright sunlight.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBut it's not just about brightness - both devices prioritize eye care, too. Incorporating Circular Polarization Technology, which converts the screen's linear polarized light into circularly polarized light, the display closely mimics natural light for a more comfortable viewing experience. Coupled with 3840Hz high-frequency PWM dimming and 16,000-level auto brightness adjustment, the displays adapt effortlessly to varying light conditions, ensuring optimal comfort. With TÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Hardware Solution) Certification, TÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certification, and TÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certification, these devices minimize eye strain, even during prolonged sessions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eThe display experience extends to touch responsiveness, where AI-powered enhancements ensure smooth interaction even with wet fingers, oil, or gloves¹⁴. For added convenience, POCO introduces an ultrasonic fingerprint sensor for the first time, providing instant unlocking for faster, more secure access.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePremium design meets robust durability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO F7 Series delivers groundbreaking performance and a design that truly embodies the essence of a flagship. With a perfect blend of aesthetics and durability, these devices set a new benchmark in premium craftsmanship.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/263_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/621027564de242dd65b8abc6a4b96ffc.jpg\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDesigned to captivate, POCO F7 Ultra and POCO F7 Pro feature advanced gloss-matte craftsmanship on their glass back covers. The upper half of the back shines with a glossy finish, while the lower half contrasts with a matte effect, creating a striking visual balance. POCO F7 Ultra further elevates this design with its quad-curved glass, enhancing the ergonomic grip with smooth curves, making it a pleasure to hold.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/63_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/c37da8da365a37c9900ea54a546464ad.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eWith a seamless top design - making its debut on a POCO device - flowing smoothly into a matte metal frame, POCO F7 Ultra and POCO F7 Pro exude a new level of sophistication. Completing the look, a circular segmentation design and an aerospace-grade aluminum deco ring around the camera enhance symmetry while evoking a sense of speed and power.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBuilt to withstand everyday challenges, POCO F7 Series boasts an IP68 rating for dust and water resistance¹⁵, offering reliable protection in extreme conditions. POCO F7 Ultra takes durability a step further with POCO Shield Glass, the toughest screen protection ever on a POCO device, safeguarding against drops and scratches - meanwhile, POCO F7 Pro benefits from Corning® Gorilla® Glass 7i, offering reinforced durability for everyday resilience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBoosting user experience with enhanced connectivity and audio\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFlagship performance deserves an equally exceptional user experience, and POCO F7 Series delivers on that front. Powered by the Surge T1S tuner, a dedicated signal enhancement chipset, POCO F7 Ultra and POCO F7 Pro offer significant improvements in connectivity, boosting cellular performance by up to 37% in mid-high frequencies¹⁶ and enhancing Wi-Fi and Bluetooth performance by up to 16%¹⁶. On the entertainment front, Stereo Dual Speakers deliver immersive, powerful sound, while AI Super Cinema¹⁷ enhances both audio and visuals, transforming every moment into a cinematic experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/846_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/84e0d79022585c2099468904668fce6d.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct availability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO F7 Ultra is available in two colors: Yellow and Black.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 12GB+256GB, and 16GB+512GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO F7 Pro will be available in three colors: Black, Silver and Blue.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 12GB+256GB, and 12GB+512GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Please consult the local seller on the availability of color, storage and RAM variant.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Price and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003emi.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹ CPU, GPU, AI data tested by POCO Internal Labs, compared with Snapdragon® 8 Gen 3 Mobile Platform, actual results may vary. CPU performance data based on Geekbench 6 test, and power consumption data based on SPECint2K6. GPU performance and power consumption data based on GFXbench 5 1080P AztecRuins Vulkan. AI performance data based on the MLPerf Super Resolution Model.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e² Data tested based on AnTuTu v10.4.4 by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e³ 2K Super resolution, 120FPS Smart frame rate (The actual frame rate depends on the performance dashboard in the Game Turbo) and Game HDR effect on games including but not limited to all games covered under the game category of the GetApps/Mi App Mall. Features may vary depending on software version, please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁴ Dual-core Visuals is only available in YouTube and Netflix and effects on certain scenarios, plesae refer to the actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁵ Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS 2 features, apps and services may vary depending on region, software version and phone model.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁶ Xiaomi HyperConnect and AI features available via OTA starting from 27 March, 2025. Availability of AI features may vary based on region. Please check your local website for more information. Internet connection required. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁷ Results for illustrative purposes may vary. Check responses for accuracy. Internet connection and compatible operating system required. Availability may vary by device, country and language. Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁸ Data tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary depending on specific testing environments, software versions, and other factors. One hour game test, 25℃ ambient temperature, in-game render resolution setting as highest and FPS setting as 60. Super Resolution mode and Smart Frame Rate mode ON.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁹ Smart Frame Rate on POCO F7 Pro is only available on supported apps and the actual frame rate depends on the performance dashboard in the Game Turbo. Effects may vary depending on in-game settings.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹º Data tested by POCO Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹¹ Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹² 34 minutes to 100% is the charging data by using the 120W in-box charger, manually enable \"Top speed\" mode while keeping the display off. Data is obtained from POCO Internal Labs with a test room temperature of approximately 25℃. Actual results may vary due to different test environments. Please refer to actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹³ Wireless chargers sold separately. Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult our online store on third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹⁴ AI glove touch may vary due to factors such as the usage environment, the material of the gloves, or their thickness. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹⁵ The device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage and/or disassembly needed for repair. Please visit official website for more information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹⁶ Data tested by POCO Internal Labs in comparison to POCO F7 Ultra and F7 Pro test devices without Surge T1S Tuner. The test results may vary due to network conditions, environment, and other factors. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹⁷ AI Super Cinema is only available for YouTube, Netflix, Amazon Video, and MIUI Video player and is not available for encrypted videos or HDR videos.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2487","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1743066104"},"common":null}